  "body": "## What changed\n\n**Stacked on #595** (issue #585), which adds `Columns::cell()`. Merge #595 first. This is M7.3 step 5 of 6 (#26).\n\nThe `camcraft-sim` headless CLI built a `Dexel` block and called the column engine's `simulate` directly.\n- **Now:** it builds `Stock::block(Backend::Field { band: FIELD_BAND }, …)`, runs `Stock::simulate`, and reads removed volume, cut cells and lowest cut column by column through `Stock::columns()` (`Columns::cell`/`nx`/`ny`/`top_at`).\n- **No-verdict columns:** a field column with no verdict (NaN) counts as uncut, the same abstention every `Columns` consumer makes.\n- **Result:** no `Dexel` remains in the binary.\n\nDecision record: `docs/decisions/588-cli-on-stock.md`.\n\n## Readings: identical output before and after\n\nI recorded the binary's full output on 5 golden programs × 2 tool diameters, before (column engine) and after (field engine): `crates/app/tests/golden/<file>.cl` with box `-60 -60 -25 60 60 0`. **Every line matched**, including the exit code and verdict.\n\n| Program / tool | Removed volume mm³ | Cut cells |\n|---|---|---|\n| contour_disc_hole / 6 | 3929.625 | 6986 |\n| contour_disc_hole / 10 | 6581.250 | 4212 |\n| face_square_40x40 / 6 | 3381.188 | 12022 |\n| face_square_40x40 / 10 | 4730.469 | 6055 |\n| pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island / 6 | 2346.188 | 4171 |\n| pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island / 10 | 3726.562 | 2385 |\n| slot_fullwidth_centerline / 6 (exit 2, FLAGGED) | 2247.750 | 2664 |\n| slot_fullwidth_centerline / 10 (exit 2, FLAGGED) | 3843.750 | 1640 |\n| drill_plate / 6 | 224.297 | 399 |\n| drill_plate / 10 | 650.000 | 416 |\n\n## How tested\n\n- **`headless_bin`, 3/3:** the slot volume, the rapid-through-stock flag and bad-input refusals.\n- **`scripts/gate.sh quick`:** the sim and app suites pass. Named: prior_columns 2, stock_columns 3, stock_backend_parity 13.\n- **`cargo clippy -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings`:** clean.\n- No golden or snapshot changed.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe field engine is slower than the column engine in a debug build on large boxes. The CLI's documented use is release mode.\n\nChangelog: none (internal: the headless sim CLI runs on the field engine; output unchanged)\n\nFixes #588\nRefs #26\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n",
